@page "/About"
<h3>AboutMe (Nora :))</h3>
<div class="AboutMe">
  <p>
    I'm Dutch, @age years old and currently studying software development.
    I'm fascinated by all aspects of game development, but I'm particularly drawn to team workflows.
    As for my hobbies, I spend most of my free time online gaming with friends.
    We’ve got a nice little all Dutch gaming/development group. I can always ask for support from them if I’m stuck on
    something.
    When I’m not calling or vibing with them I’m either coding, learning a language, drawing, working out or on the
    archery range.
    My most important qualities from my perspective would probably be my honesty, directness and my drivenness.
    When introduced to a new subject I will go for it with everything I’ve got. Same goes for taking the lead in my
    project groups.
    I enjoy making sure that my projects run nice and smooth with proper communication.
  </p>
  <img src="/images/nora@0.5x.png" />
</div>

@code {
  DateTime birthday = new DateTime(2006, 3, 27);
  int age;
  string spotifyAPILenght = "1886";

  protected override void OnInitialized()
  {
    age = DateTime.Now.Year - birthday.Year;
    // If the birthday hasn't occurred yet this year, subtract one from the age
    if (DateTime.Now.DayOfYear < birthday.DayOfYear)
      age--;
  }
}